## Documentation Demos
<hr class="section-rule lvl-2">

Live demos of the doc-site macros and Markdown extensions this project uses.  Each
family of examples lives on its own page so they stay small and focused; this page
is the index.

!!! outline "Demo pages"
    * [Admonitions](admonitions/) &mdash; the styled `!!!` callout blocks.
    * [Prose Cards](cards/) &mdash; the frosted editorial `.cmk-card` blockquotes.
    * [Figures & Images](figures/) &mdash; `figure_table` / `figure_framed`.
    * [Embeddings](embeddings/) &mdash; images, collapsed-includes, file embeds, snippets.
    * [API Links](api/) &mdash; `site.api_link` / `api_link_many` / `parse_module_help`.
    * [CLI Showcase](cli/) &mdash; `cli_example` / `cli_output` code blocks + inline examples.
    * [Footnotes](footnotes/) &mdash; the `[^ref]` footnote extension.

